son: Q: h4-f2+ delivers check while placing my Queen on the critical f2 square, exploiting White's uncastled King position. This forcing move maintains my initiative and keeps White's King under severe pressure, potentially leading to a quick tactical win.\n\nAnswer: Q: h4-f2"}
